# Generated by Cargo
debug
target

# Generated conformance reports are local review artifacts.
/conformance/**/*.html
/conformance/CONFORMANCE_v2.*

# The workspace Cargo.lock is committed for reproducible CI and demo builds.
# Nested crate/demo lockfiles are not used.
/protocols/Cargo.lock
/tokenizers/Cargo.lock
/parsers/Cargo.lock
/renderer/Cargo.lock
/examples/*/Cargo.lock

# rustfmt backups
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these
*.pdb

# cargo mutants
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover / IntelliJ
#.idea/

# Unified: build tree. gen_unified_golden.py authors golden_spec/ here and the
# harness/exploder write captures + unified_results.yaml here; the committed data
# is the plain versioned YAML history under conformance/fixtures-unified-v2/.
conformance/unified/
conformance/CONFORMANCE_unified.html
